      "title": "Exposure & limit utilization",
      "description": "Gross/net notional and their utilization against the LIVE risk_limit gauges (\u00a712.6). One money unit throughout: qty x qty_unit x price_ticks x tick_size, converted to USD (\u00a712.1).",
